WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
This is how to send your location to Quickler on Telegram.

2
00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:08.020
It's very similar to WhatsApp, where you first press the paperclip.

3
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:12.740
From there you'll see under the bottom bar the Location option.

4
00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:13.460
Select that.

5
00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:17.900
From there you can select your current location and you can also

6
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.960
choose other locations, should you need to.

7
00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:26.980
On Telegram there's the extra benefit, which is like iOS on

8
00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:32.340
WhatsApp, you can do this as well, you can change the base map to

9
00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:37.160
Satellite, which allows you to choose very specific items, for

10
00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:39.400
example this allotment in Dundee.

11
00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:43.700
You can then send that selected location and the process is done.
